# The dev image is a toolchain only — the working tree is bind-mounted at run
# time, never copied in. So the context is an allowlist of the two paths this
# Dockerfile actually COPYs, which keeps the context transfer near-instant.
#
# Re-including a path requires re-including each of its parents first: Docker
# will not resurrect a file whose directory is still excluded.
*
!.docker
.docker/*
!.docker/certs
!.docker/dev
.docker/dev/*
!.docker/dev/entrypoint.sh
